          },
          "font-size": {
            "type": "float",
            "value": 19
          },
          "text": {
            "type": "string",
            "value": "VIDEO EFFECTS\n\nThe Video Effects category contains a set of nodes that manipulate textures in creative ways.\nVideo Effects want the Texture2Drgba type and also output Texture2Drgba themself.\n\nThis also brings up the topic of conversion.\nThe Blur node below would like a Texture2Drgba type.\nIt will also accept Texture2dchannel or Shape2D, but it will convert it to Texture2Drgba internally.\n\nMost effects take a single Texture2Drgba type, but some effects like UV Offset, Mask and UV Map need two.\nThe main inlet is used for the texture that you want to process, the other to process it with.\n\nAssignment: create a node from the Video Source category and add three effects to it."
          }
        },
        "bounds": {
          "height": 859.5653076171875,
          "width": 768.8826904296875,
          "x": 725.4107666015625,
          "y": 320.9568176269531
        },
        "class": {
          "id": "77697265-3C1D-467D-A722-0FC566538374",
          "version": 1
        },
        "clock": "video",
        "color": "fff26eb5",
        "constants": {},
        "hidden": [
          "text",
